      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, just looking at the cloud spend reports for this sprint. the CI/CD pipeline costs are still way higher than we projected, mostly driven by the heavy compute usage during the orchestration phase. we need to find a way to cut these costs down significantly by the end of the week or we're gonna have to look at replacing the heavy orchestration layer with some lighter, script-based automation to save on overhead. can u run a diagnostic and see what we can trim?",
